                <mxCell id="IhaG7bLdroTA-BpcZFBZ-57" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;this identifies the device type and carries type-specific information&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;equivalent to the kobj_type of a kboject&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;a class or bus can contain devices of different types&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
