                <mxCell id="IhaG7bLdroTA-BpcZFBZ-58" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;The device&#39;s &quot;parent&quot; device, the device to which it is attached.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In most cases, a parent device is some sort of bus or host controller&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If parent is NULL, the device, is a top-level device, which is not usually what you want.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
